     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">So my question is how to\r\nhandle confounders in my model.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Edecdur = dependant var<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">leismeth = independent var<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">MVAT, bpsystgem, glucose1, trig1, hdlc1 = mediators<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Leeftijdm, sexe, smoking, ethniciteit, educatie =\r\nconfounders<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Initially I added them as highlighted in yellow. However,\r\nthe statistician who helps me mentioned to also add them as highlighted in\r\ngreen with the mediators, though the statistician is not certain.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Is that correct?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">#Define model</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">modeledec_correlated &lt;- &#39;</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"># direct effect</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm;background:yellow\">Edecdur ~ c*leismeth + leeftijd + sexe +\r\nsmoking + ethniciteit + educatie</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"># mediator</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">MVAT ~ a1*leismeth <span style=\"background:lime\">+ leeftijd + sexe + smoking + ethniciteit + educatie</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">bpsystgem ~ a2*leismeth <span style=\"background:lime\">+ leeftijd + sexe + smoking + ethniciteit + educatie</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">glucose1 ~ a3*leismeth<span style=\"background:lime\">+\r\nleeftijd + sexe + smoking + ethniciteit + educatie</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">trig1 ~ a4*leismeth<span style=\"background:lime\">+\r\nleeftijd + sexe + smoking + ethniciteit + educatie</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">hdlc1 ~ a5*leismeth<span style=\"background:lime\">+\r\nleeftijd + sexe + smoking + ethniciteit + educatie</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Edecdur ~ b1*MVAT</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Edecdur ~ b2*bpsystgem</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Edecdur ~ b3*glucose1</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Edecdur ~ b4*trig1</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Edecdur ~ b5*hdlc1</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">MVAT ~~ bpsystgem + glucose1 + trig1 + hdlc1</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">bpsystgem ~~ glucose1 + trig1 + hdlc1</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">glucose1 ~~   trig1 + hdlc1</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">trig1 ~~ hdlc1</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"># indirect effect (a*b)</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">ab1 := a1*b1</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">ab2 := a2*b2</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">ab3 := a3*b3</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">ab4 := a4*b4</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">ab5 := a5*b5</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"># direct</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">direff := c</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"># total effect</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">total := direff + ab1 + ab2 + ab3 + ab4 + ab5</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"># pct mediated</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">med1 := 100*ab1 / total</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">med2 := 100*ab2 / total</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">med3 := 100*ab3 / total</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">med4 := 100*ab4 / total</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">med5 := 100*ab5 / total</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">&#39;</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"NL\"> </span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
