    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">H.,<br>  It is a matter of personal preference.  I do not believe that any one application dominates the field at the moment.  However, I have used PowerPoint and Dia, the latter of which is now my preference.  Curved arrows can sometimes be tricky in PowerPoint, especially when both ends point to the same variable.  Dia has a little more of a learning curve because it does more.  You may need to adjust the resolution before exporting.  In both programs, it tends to work well to create on object, format it as desired, an then duplicate it for other objects.<br><br><a href=\"https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Dia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Dia/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421871518000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0R3Q7T7Lw2CQ75947Fox5R\">https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Dia/</a><br><br>  I have heard others say good things about Onyx although I have not used it myself.<br><br><a href=\"https://onyx.brandmaier.de/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://onyx.brandmaier.de/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421871518000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2gFZ0h-hY0Ud0V40QTsRre\">https://onyx.brandmaier.de/</a><br><br>  I think that your basic layout is sound.  You just need more space in between variables and higher  and more varied arches on the curved arrows.<br><br>Keith<br>------------------------<br>Keith A. Markus<br>John Jay College of Criminal Justice, CUNY<br><a href=\"http://jjcweb.jjay.cuny.edu/kmarkus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jjcweb.jjay.cuny.edu/kmarkus&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421871518000&amp;usg=AOvVaw004VHpSa6hV-SvYk8p5AOE\">http://jjcweb.jjay.cuny.edu/kmarkus</a><br>Frontiers of Test Validity Theory: Measurement, Causation and Meaning.<br><a href=\"http://www.routledge.com/books/details/9781841692203/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.routledge.com/books/details/9781841692203/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421871518000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HbapiwZr-p8vZkER2VdYb\">http://www.routledge.com/books/details/9781841692203/</a><br><br></div>"
    ]
